WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.539
A little while later, Aunt Martha returned from shopping.

2
00:00:04.540 --> 00:00:09.653
"That's strange," she said, noticing the dirty rug.

3
00:00:09.654 --> 00:00:13.751
"Children? Are you home?" she called out.

4
00:00:13.752 --> 00:00:18.447
"In here!" came a voice from the kitchen.

5
00:00:18.448 --> 00:00:25.212
With a shopping bag in one arm and Lamb in the other, Aunt Martha walked toward the voice.

6
00:00:25.213 --> 00:00:30.382
Bobby was eating his second peanut butter sandwich when Aunt Martha entered the kitchen.

7
00:00:30.383 --> 00:00:36.658
"Oh, my!" she gasped, dropping the bag and almost dropping Lamb too.

8
00:00:36.659 --> 00:00:40.044
"Who are you?" she shouted at Bobby.

9
00:00:40.045 --> 00:00:42.634
Bobby looked up from his sandwich.

10
00:00:42.635 --> 00:00:46.209
"It's me, Aunt Martha," he said.

11
00:00:46.210 --> 00:00:51.389
But of course Aunt Martha did not recognize the boy sitting in her kitchen.

12
00:00:51.390 --> 00:00:57.597
Aunt Martha hurried to put Lamb down, and Cy walked in, fresh from his shower.

13
00:00:57.598 --> 00:01:02.915
"Hey, I'll have a sandwich now," he said to his brother.

14
00:01:02.916 --> 00:01:07.373
"What? Another one?" Aunt Martha exclaimed.

15
00:01:07.374 --> 00:01:10.820
Alarmed, she grabbed a broom.

16
00:01:10.821 --> 00:01:14.149
"Aunt Martha," Cy tried to explain.

17
00:01:14.150 --> 00:01:17.425
"I'm not your aunt!" she shouted.

18
00:01:17.426 --> 00:01:20.115
"And how do you know my name?"

19
00:01:20.116 --> 00:01:24.606
She waved the broom in their faces.

20
00:01:24.607 --> 00:01:30.823
Upstairs, Panther was staring at the beautiful girl in the mirror.

21
00:01:30.824 --> 00:01:35.144
"Panther, should I wear my pink blouse or my blue one?"

22
00:01:35.145 --> 00:01:37.600
Jane called from the next room.

23
00:01:37.601 --> 00:01:42.595
"I don't know. Pick your favorite," Panther replied carelessly.

24
00:01:42.596 --> 00:01:46.670
Panther had grown up believing that she wasn't pretty.

25
00:01:46.671 --> 00:01:52.855
"I would be so much happier if I was beautiful," she had always thought.

26
00:01:52.856 --> 00:01:57.321
She turned her face to the side, still examining her reflection.

27
00:01:57.322 --> 00:02:02.369
"Now I am beautiful," she said, as if to convince herself.

28
00:02:02.370 --> 00:02:06.472
But who was the "self" looking back at her?

29
00:02:06.473 --> 00:02:10.294
Jane walked in, interrupting Panther's thoughts.

30
00:02:10.295 --> 00:02:11.554
"Let's go down.

31
00:02:11.555 --> 00:02:14.289
I hear Aunt Martha," she said.

32
00:02:14.290 --> 00:02:16.539
Panther looked at her sister.

33
00:02:16.540 --> 00:02:19.690
"Oh!" she said with a startled breath.

34
00:02:19.691 --> 00:02:23.677
"What is it?" asked Jane, looking around.

35
00:02:23.678 --> 00:02:26.004
Panther shook her head.

36
00:02:26.005 --> 00:02:28.736
"Nothing, it's just . . ."

37
00:02:28.737 --> 00:02:31.413
"What?" asked Jane.

38
00:02:31.414 --> 00:02:37.712
"I didn't recognize you," Panther replied, embarrassed.

39
00:02:37.713 --> 00:02:41.704
Back in the kitchen, Cy and Bobby were in big trouble.

40
00:02:41.705 --> 00:02:45.116
"We're telling you the truth," Cy pleaded.

41
00:02:45.117 --> 00:02:48.266
"I'm Cy and that's Bobby!"

42
00:02:48.267 --> 00:02:52.003
Aunt Martha was not going to let herself be fooled.

43
00:02:52.004 --> 00:02:55.324
"Do you think I'm stupid?" she said.

44
00:02:55.325 --> 00:02:59.540
"You are not Cy, and you are not Bobby!"

45
00:02:59.541 --> 00:03:03.255
Just then, Panther and Jane stepped into the kitchen.

46
00:03:03.256 --> 00:03:08.251
"Aunt Martha! What are you doing?" they cried.

47
00:03:08.252 --> 00:03:11.291
For a second, Aunt Martha was stunned.

48
00:03:11.292 --> 00:03:15.739
"How many more of you are there?" she shouted.

49
00:03:15.740 --> 00:03:19.935
Aunt Martha's angry voice made Lamb cry.

50
00:03:19.936 --> 00:03:23.181
Panther ran over to comfort her baby brother.

51
00:03:23.182 --> 00:03:27.639
"It's okay, Lamb. Your sister is here," she said.

52
00:03:27.640 --> 00:03:32.545
She tried to pick him up, but Lamb only screamed more loudly.

53
00:03:32.546 --> 00:03:35.094
"What's the matter? It's me!"

54
00:03:35.095 --> 00:03:37.604
Panther said in a trembling voice.

55
00:03:37.605 --> 00:03:41.877
But Lamb's wide eyes said that he did not know her at all.

56
00:03:41.878 --> 00:03:44.638
"You stay away from that baby!"

57
00:03:44.639 --> 00:03:48.775
Aunt Martha said and swatted Panther with the broom.

58
00:03:48.776 --> 00:03:52.286
"Lamb?" Panther would not give up.

59
00:03:52.287 --> 00:03:54.333
"It's your sister."

60
00:03:54.334 --> 00:03:56.837
Lamb howled again.

61
00:03:56.838 --> 00:04:00.606
"I've had enough," Aunt Martha screamed.

62
00:04:00.607 --> 00:04:02.498
"Get out! All of you!

63
00:04:02.499 --> 00:04:04.255
Get out of my house!"

64
00:04:04.256 --> 00:04:10.081
She lifted the broom and began swinging it around like a baseball bat.

65
00:04:10.082 --> 00:04:13.124
The Barth children ran out, upset.

66
00:04:13.125 --> 00:04:20.206
Not only Aunt Martha, but even baby Lamb did not recognize them anymore.

67
00:04:20.207 --> 00:04:24.809
"I can't believe Lamb didn't know me," cried Panther.

68
00:04:24.810 --> 00:04:29.022
"Well, I hope you're happy," Cy said hotly.

69
00:04:29.023 --> 00:04:31.612
"You wanted to be beautiful."

70
00:04:31.613 --> 00:04:35.327
"I don't blame Lamb," Bobby gasped.

71
00:04:35.328 --> 00:04:37.692
"Even I don't know you.

72
00:04:37.693 --> 00:04:41.329
I don't know myself."

